items.rem:
Except for RNP AR APCH/DEP and dispatch on the basis of GNSS Primary Means Navigation, one may be inoperative, provided:
a) Associated ADS-B Extended Squitter Transmission system is considered inoperative – MEL 34-18-02A must also be applied, and;
b) Clocks – Automatic Update function is considered inoperative – MEL 31-01- 01 must also be applied.
